OL,3,GNEWSA'New York coffee stop on 9/11
OL,4,Asaved my life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was in New York during the
OL,7,F9/11 attacks said he would have been at
OL,8,Fthe twin towers when the planes hit if
OL,9,Fhe had not stopped for a coffee.
OL,11,FNearly 3,000 people were killed when
OL,12,Ftwo of the four planes were hijacked
OL,13,Fand used to crash into the World Trade
OL,14,FCentre on the morning of 11 September
OL,15,F2001.
OL,17,FPaul Lilley, manager of HSBC in
OL,18,FChippenham at the time, was in New York
OL,19,Fwith his wife Wendy for their 20th
OL,20,Fwedding anniversary.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
