OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F349A1789138553
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSA'New York coffee stop on 9/11
OL,4,Asaved my life'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We were on our way to the twin towers
OL,7,Fwhen everything kicked off," he said.
OL,8,F"If it hadn't been for my wife wanting
OL,9,Fto stop and have a coffee, we probably
OL,10,Fwould have been very near to the towers
OL,11,Fwhen the planes hit."
